---
source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
  x a module pin cannot be `unpinned`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-unpinned/image.kdl:14:17]
 13 |             pin {
 14 |                 unpinned "trusted"
    :                 ^^^^|^^^
    :                     `-- nothing would verify what arrived
 15 |                 version "main"
    `----
  help: only a module collection follows a moving ref: a fetched module is
        arbitrary shell running as root in the build, and an asset lands in
        the image

  x `hashed` is both pinned and unpinned
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-unpinned/repo.kdl:13:9]
 12 |         sha256 "b7c232b0e8249d8e55a40beb79c5c43a7d370f3f9408bd215deb0170daeaadf3"
 13 |         unpinned "trusted"
    :         ^^^^|^^^
    :             `-- one of these is not true
 14 |     }
    `----
  help: drop `unpinned` when `sha256` verifies the selected version

  x `unselected` verifies a hash but selects no version
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-unpinned/repo.kdl:17:9]
 16 |         url "https://github.com/owner/modules"
 17 |         sha256 "b7c232b0e8249d8e55a40beb79c5c43a7d370f3f9408bd215deb0170daeaadf3"
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- the remote HEAD can move
 18 |     }
    `----
  help: add `version` with the branch, tag or commit this canonical archive
        hashes

  x `here` is a local directory
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-unpinned/repo.kdl:21:9]
 20 |         dir "../modules"
 21 |         unpinned "trusted"
    :         ^^^^|^^^
    :             `-- only a Git source accepts this field
 22 |     }
    `----
  help: a local source needs only `dir`; pinning fields describe a fetched
        repository

  x `loose` is not fetched
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-unpinned/image.kdl:12:9]
 11 |     modules {
 12 |         module "loose" {
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- no module.kdl here yet
 13 |             pin {
    `----
  help: run ./generated/scripts/tect.sh fetch modules to fetch what the image
        references
